 "text": "Health Department\nComanche County\nHome\nParcel Search\nElected\nAppointed\nOther Depts\nCommunity\nCOMANCHE COUNTY HEALTH DEPARTMENT\n﻿ a member of\nSouth Central Coalition for Public Health\n​Serving Barber , Comanche , Edwards , Harper , Kingman , Kiowa and Pratt Counties\nWorking together for Healthy People and Strong Communities\n​\n​ Address: 207 S Washington Street/PO Box 433\nColdwater, KS 67029-0433\nOffice Hours: Mon-Thu 9:00 am-5:00 pm; Fri 9:00 am-12:00 noon\nAdministrator: Jerri McKnight, BSN, RN Phone: 620-582-2431 Fax: 620-582-2491\nEmail: jmcknight@comanchecountyks.gov\nHealth Officer: Dr James Stanford, MD\nEmail: j im.stanford@gmail.com Phone: 620-582-2431 Fax: 620-582-2491\nEnvironmental Health Contact: Environmental Phone: 620-582-2933\nEnvironmental Email:\nMedical Consultant: Daniel Schowengerdt, MD\nOur mission is to promote health and prevent disease and injury by assessing community health status and developing health policies and programs.\nWe strive to assure that necessary, high quality services are available to\neveryone in our community.\nIMPORTANT HEALTH LINKS\n|\n|\nWebsite by McCully & Associates Media .........Copyright© Comanche County, Ks. 2026\nAcessibility\n|\n|\nHome\nParcel Search\nElected\nCommissioners\n>\nCommissioners' Minutes\nCounty Clerk\n>\nLevies\nElection Information\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nCounty Attorney\nAppointed\nAppraiser\n>\nAppraiser's Forms\nChange of Address Online Form\nSale of Property Online Form\nRoad & Bridge\nEmergency Management\nSolid Waste\nAmbulance\nNoxious Weed\nOther Depts\nClerk of the District Court\nHealth Department\n>\nHealth Links\nAirport\nExtension Office\nCommunity\nCommissioners\n>\nCommissioners' Minutes\nCounty Clerk\n>\nLevies\nElection Information\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nCounty Attorney\nAppraiser\n>\nAppraiser's Forms\nChange of Address Online Form\nSale of Property Online Form\nRoad & Bridge\nEmergency Management\nSolid Waste\nAmbulance